  .normalizeEmail({
    gmail_remove_dots: false,
    gmail_remove_subaddress: false,
    outlook_remove_subaddress: false,
  });
```

### 4. Comprehensive Error Handling Structure
```javascript
const errorHandler = (err, req, res, next) => {
